[ti:Where Are You Now?]
[ar:Moodify]
[language:en]
[by:Moodify — score/MIDI-aligned translation]
[offset:0]

[00:13.93]Where are you now?
[00:16.84]Not on the map, not in the city
[00:23.91]But in your changing heart
[00:26.83]In your weariness, in your desires
[00:31.23]I don't want to love only
[00:34.84]The one who moved me at the beginning
[00:38.88]I also want to recognize
[00:41.57]The one who returns in a different way
[00:46.32]Time does not ask
[00:49.35]That love remain still
[00:53.06]It asks whether we are willing
[00:56.55]To keep searching for each other in the current
[01:04.32]Where are you now?
[01:08.03]I want to come a little closer
[01:10.36]Without forcing you back
[01:12.91]Without losing you in my memories
[01:15.82]Where are you now?
[01:19.19]Just tell me of a light
[01:23.02]A fear, a need, a silence
[01:25.91]And I will walk more gently toward you
[01:31.96]I am no longer the same either
[01:35.67]I have new cautions
[01:39.26]Slownesses I did not have before
[01:42.64]And tendernesses that are beginning
[01:46.12]If you want, let us not live
[01:48.68]Only in the most beautiful moments
[01:52.03]Let us create today, however small
[01:55.99]A place that tomorrow can remember
[02:00.29]This is not the end
[02:04.22]When two people change
[02:07.82]It may be an invitation
[02:11.88]To introduce ourselves again
[02:15.26]Where are you now?
[02:18.27]I don't want to say goodbye too quickly
[02:21.99]I want to ask the tender question
[02:25.48]That keeps us among the living
[02:28.02]Where are you now?
[02:31.85]If you still let me come to you
[02:35.92]I will not take your change for a loss
[02:40.80]But as a path
[02:44.28]That I want to learn with you
